%!PS
% Page de test : une image « photographique » de 1500 x 1500 pixels et du texte.
<< /PageSize [612 792] >> setpagedevice
/W 1500 def /H 1500 def
/row W 3 mul string def
/clamp { dup 0 lt { pop 0 } if dup 255 gt { pop 255 } if cvi } def
/y 0 def
/Helvetica findfont 24 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto (PDF Compress - page de test) show
gsave
36 120 translate 540 540 scale
W H 8 [W 0 0 H neg 0 H]
{
  0 1 W 1 sub {
    /x exch def
    row x 3 mul       x 0.31 mul y 0.17 mul add sin 100 mul 128 add rand 24 mod add clamp put
    row x 3 mul 1 add x 0.11 mul y 0.29 mul sub cos 90 mul 128 add rand 24 mod add clamp put
    row x 3 mul 2 add x y add 0.07 mul sin 110 mul 128 add rand 24 mod add clamp put
  } for
  /y y 1 add def
  row
}
false 3 colorimage
grestore
showpage
